# After adding your key, uncomment the line above. The map will
# automatically upgrade from Leaflet to Google Maps.

# ── Google OAuth (via Supabase) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Google Login is managed by Supabase — NO client ID needed here.
# To enable Google Login, go to your Supabase dashboard:
#   1. Authentication → Providers → Google
#   2. Enable Google provider
#   3. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   4. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application)
#   5. Authorized redirect URI: https://xptwtdgoiqcxriwffcsm.supabase.co/auth/v1/callback
#   6. Paste Client ID + Client Secret into Supabase → Google provider settings
#
